(MIT), listed with sources and checksums in
internal/web/static/vendor/README.md. The mermaid bundle includes
third-party code under its own licenses, named in the license comments of
mermaid.min.js: DOMPurify (Apache-2.0 or MPL-2.0), lodash-es (MIT) and
other MIT-licensed libraries. The mermaid bundle includes
third-party code under its own licenses, named in the license comments of
mermaid.min.js: DOMPurify (Apache-2.0 or MPL-2.0), lodash-es (MIT) and
